Description: Edukasaun Desktop 0.9.14 - Transparency, Liquid Glass and Login Fix
 Edukasaun Desktop, Eduka-Menu, Eduka-Menu Settings, and Eduka-Panel.
 Restores the transparent theme by making sure a compositor runs (xfwm4,
 KWin or picom) and by drawing a clean opaque look instead of black when none
 does, stabilises Liquid Glass, stops LXQt from asking for a window manager
 and leaves Eduka-Desktop as the only session on SDDM and LightDM.
